    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000tiur](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000tiur) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Sep 21 2026 36km NE of Ruteng. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -8.307 longitude 120.5793. It impacted 350717 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
